{"type": "text", "text": "I have gathered all the necessary information. Here is my report.

## AI Tutor Suggestion Feature — File Inventory

### 1. TutorSuggestionComponent (.ts)
**`/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/communication/course-conversations/tutor-suggestion/tutor-suggestion.component.ts`**

Angular standalone component (`selector: 'jhi-tutor-suggestion'`) that displays an Iris tutor suggestion inside the course-conversation chat. It gates on the `TutorSuggestions` feature toggle, the `PROFILE_IRIS` profile, `isAtLeastTutorInCourse`, unresolved posts, and the `irisTutorSuggestionSettings.enabled` course setting. It switches the chat service to `ChatServiceMode.TUTOR_SUGGESTION`, subscribes to messages/stages/errors, and calls `chatService.requestTutorSuggestion()`. Full contents shown below.

### 2. Template + SCSS for the component
- **`/workspace/repo/.../tutor-suggestion/tutor-suggestion.component.html`** — the component's HTML template.
- **`/workspace/repo/.../tutor-suggestion/tutor-suggestion.component.scss`** — the component's styles.

### 3. IrisErrorMessageKey (enum definition)
**`/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/iris/shared/entities/iris-errors.model.ts`** — defines the `IrisErrorMessageKey` enum (e.g. `SESSION_LOAD_FAILED`, `SEND_MESSAGE_FAILED`), the `IrisErrorType` interface, the `IrisErrors` array (marking each key fatal/non-fatal), and the frozen `errorMessages` lookup map.

Other files that *reference* the enum: `iris-chat.service.ts`, `iris-base-chatbot.component.ts`, and the tutor-suggestion component.

### 4. requestTutorSuggestion (Iris chat service)
**`/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/iris/overview/services/iris-chat.service.ts`** — defines `ChatServiceMode.TUTOR_SUGGESTION` (line 27) and the `requestTutorSuggestion(): Observable<undefined>` method (line 205), which POSTs via `this.http.createTutorSuggestion(this.sessionId)`. The `.spec.ts` sibling tests it.

### 5. Server-side tutor suggestion DTO / pipeline (Java)
A note on your premise: the dedicated tutor-suggestion DTOs do **not** literally contain `textExerciseDTO`/`programmingExerciseDTO` fields. The only tutor-suggestion-related Java file that references a programming/text exercise DTO is the shared pipeline service:

- **`/workspace/repo/src/main/java/de/tum/cit/aet/artemis/iris/service/pyris/PyrisPipelineService.java`** — imports `PyrisTutorSuggestionPipelineExecutionDTO`; `executeTutorSuggestionPipeline(...)` (line 245) builds that DTO. The `toPyrisProgrammingExerciseDTO(exercise)` call at line 174 belongs to a *different* pipeline method in the same file (the exercise-chat pipeline), not the tutor-suggestion one.

The core tutor-suggestion server files are:
- **`.../iris/service/pyris/dto/chat/tutorsuggestion/PyrisTutorSuggestionPipelineExecutionDTO.java`** — record sent to Pyris (course, optional exerciseId, post, chatHistory, user, settings, initialStages). Does **not** embed text/programming exercise DTOs directly.
- **`.../iris/service/pyris/dto/TutorSuggestionStatusUpdateDTO.java`** — status update record (`artifact`, `result`, `stages`, `tokens`).
- **`.../iris/service/pyris/job/TutorSuggestionJob.java`** — the Pyris job type.
- **`.../iris/service/session/IrisTutorSuggestionSessionService.java`** — session service.
- **`.../iris/web/IrisTutorSuggestionSessionResource.java`** — REST resource (backs `createTutorSuggestion`).
- **`.../iris/domain/session/IrisTutorSuggestionSession.java`**, **`.../iris/repository/IrisTutorSuggestionSessionRepository.java`** — domain + repository.
- **`.../iris/domain/settings/IrisTutorSuggestionSubSettings.java`**, **`.../iris/dto/IrisCombinedTutorSuggestionSubSettingsDTO.java`** — settings.

The actual `TextExerciseDTO`/`ProgrammingExerciseDTO` classes (Athena and Pyris variants) live at, e.g., `.../athena/dto/TextExerciseDTO.java`, `.../athena/dto/ProgrammingExerciseDTO.java`, `.../iris/service/pyris/dto/data/PyrisTextExerciseDTO.java`, `.../iris/service/pyris/dto/data/PyrisProgrammingExerciseDTO.java` — but these are not tutor-suggestion-specific.

### 6. Test files (do NOT modify)
- **`/workspace/repo/src/main/webapp/app/communication/course-conversations/tutor-suggestion/tutor-suggestion.component.spec.ts`** — the frontend Jest spec for the component (full contents below). Note: this is a `.spec.ts` file colocated with the component, not under a `tests/` directory. It relies on `test/helpers/mocks/iris/mock-settings`.
- **`/workspace/repo/src/test/java/de/tum/cit/aet/artemis/iris/IrisTutorSuggestionIntegrationTest.java`** — the server-side integration test.

I did not find any tutor-suggestion test file under a directory literally named `tests/`; the frontend test is the colocated `.spec.ts`.

---

